{# RENDER-ONLY. HOW LONG THE PLAYER AND ONE PERSON HAVE KNOWN EACH OTHER (2.4, WP-T).
   Not sent to any model. Rendered by SNRom_Bridge.KnownScan through
   SkyrimNetApi.RenderTemplate, with npc_formid as the one variable, before a
   seed read and before BeginSpark's tenure check. Papyrus adds what it keeps
   itself (enrollment, the first line the conversation scan saw) and decides.

   Output, one line:
     KNOWNSCAN <now> <feedOldest> <sharedOldest> <sharedCount> <memOldest> <memCount>
   all game times in game seconds, 0 for "none".

   THE LIVE FEED. get_recent_events reads SkyrimNet's in-memory feed, not the
   database: about the last 1,000 events, a few game days (measured
   2026-10-13: 760 events for the player whatever the count asked, ids
   93014-95988, 5.3 game days). Its actor filter is EITHER, so the shared
   events are kept by hand from ev.actors. If the person's oldest shared event
   is well after the feed's own oldest, their first meeting is inside the
   window and that is its date. If they are there from the feed's start, their
   history runs further back than anything a template can see.

   THE OLDEST OWN MEMORY is a lower bound only: short first meetings never
   become memories, and memories get deleted.

   UUIDs come from formid_to_uuid: 19-digit literals lose precision in a
   template and silently match nothing. npc_formid may arrive as a string. #}
{% if exists("npc_formid") %}
{% set snrom_uuid = formid_to_uuid(int(npc_formid)) %}
{% set snrom_now = default(gameTimeNumeric, 0) %}
{% set snrom_who = [] %}
{% set snrom_who = append(snrom_who, player.UUID) %}
{% set snrom_feed = get_recent_events(5000, snrom_who) %}
{% set snrom_feed_oldest = 0 %}
{% for ev in snrom_feed %}{% if ev.gameTime > 0 and (snrom_feed_oldest == 0 or ev.gameTime < snrom_feed_oldest) %}{% set snrom_feed_oldest = ev.gameTime %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% set snrom_shared_oldest = 0 %}
{% set snrom_shared = 0 %}
{% if snrom_uuid and snrom_uuid != 0 %}
{% for ev in snrom_feed %}{% set snrom_both = false %}{% for a in ev.actors %}{% if a == snrom_uuid %}{% set snrom_both = true %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if snrom_both and ev.gameTime > 0 %}{% set snrom_shared = snrom_shared + 1 %}{% if snrom_shared_oldest == 0 or ev.gameTime < snrom_shared_oldest %}{% set snrom_shared_oldest = ev.gameTime %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% set snrom_mem = get_relevant_memories(snrom_uuid, 200) %}
{% else %}
{% set snrom_mem = [] %}
{% endif %}
{% set snrom_mem_oldest = 0 %}
{% set snrom_mem_count = 0 %}
{% for am in snrom_mem %}{% set snrom_own = default(am.isOwn, true) %}{% set snrom_gt = default(am.memory.game_time, 0) %}{% if snrom_own and snrom_gt > 0 %}{% set snrom_mem_count = snrom_mem_count + 1 %}{% if snrom_mem_oldest == 0 or snrom_gt < snrom_mem_oldest %}{% set snrom_mem_oldest = snrom_gt %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
KNOWNSCAN {{ snrom_now }} {{ snrom_feed_oldest }} {{ snrom_shared_oldest }} {{ snrom_shared }} {{ snrom_mem_oldest }} {{ snrom_mem_count }}
{% else %}
KNOWNSCAN NOFORMID
{% endif %}
